{
  "id": "369",
  "title": "Do You Need These Urgently?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-09-26",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang asks how urgently Manager Wang needs the contracts copied.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/533/ae666ede72a52624e8c27f7ad79fa63a749940be.mp3?1698352457",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "您急着要吗？\n\n小张：王总，复印机坏了。总务的人说下午过来修。这份合同您急着要吗？我去外面复印室复印给您吧。\n王总：不用，我不急。你下午复印好后放我桌子上就行。\n小张：好的。",
    "traditional": "您急著要嗎？\n\n小張：王總，複印機壞了。總務的人說下午過來修。這份合同您急著要嗎？我去外面複印室複印給您吧。\n王總：不用，我不急。你下午複印好後放我桌子上就行。\n小張：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you need these urgently?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：王总，复印机坏了。",
      "traditional": "小張：王總，複印機壞了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wáng zǒng fù yìn jī huài le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "总务的人说下午过来修。",
      "traditional": "總務的人說下午過來修。",
      "pinyin": "zǒng wù de rén shuō xià wǔ guò lái xiū",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Manager Wang, the copying machine broke."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "这份合同您急着要吗？我去外面复印室复印给您吧。",
      "traditional": "這份合同您急著要嗎？我去外面複印室複印給您吧。",
      "pinyin": "zhè fèn hé tong nín jí zhe yào ma wǒ qù wài miàn fù yìn shì fù yìn gěi nín ba",
      "english": "The person at general affairs said they would come fix it this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you need these contracts urgently? I can go to the copying room outside to copy them for you."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王总：不用，我不急。你下午复印好后放我桌子上就行。",
      "traditional": "王總：不用，我不急。你下午複印好後放我桌子上就行。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng bú yòng wǒ bù jí nǐ xià wǔ fù yìn hǎo hòu fàng wǒ zhuō zi shang jiù xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: No need, I'm in no hurry. Just put them on my desk after you've copied them this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Ok."
    }
  ],
